      en: ["The city was named Pushkino from 1938 to 1991", "The historical Shahriyar fortress is located nearby", "Situated approximately 180 kilometers south of Baku", "The district was established on August 8, 1930", "A major producer of cotton seeds and various grains", "Irrigated by the Araz canal for agricultural purposes"],
