      en: ["Granted city status in the year 1941", "Located about 250 kilometers west of the capital Baku", "The district was officially formed on January 24, 1939", "A key site for the maintenance of railway infrastructure", "The region is irrigated by the Upper Shirvan Canal", "Average summer temperatures often exceed 35 degrees Celsius"],
